  exerciseNumber: 18
  exerciseName: EnemyDoesntFindPlayer
  exerciseTitle: Enemy doesn't find Player
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458786
  exerciseText: Enemy should find Player and attack it.
  hintText: Is the Physics query working correctly? It should first find 1 collider
    (Enemy) and then when it gets within range it should find 2. (Player)
  solutionText: Enemy script is using a layerMask set to None so naturally it doesn't
    find colliders in the Default layer.
